  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint:\r\n$V=u-g t$ at $t=6$\r\n$u-g t=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow u=6 g=192 f t /$ sec $\\quad\\left(g=32 f t / \\sec ^{2}\\right) \\ldots \\ldots . .(\\mathrm{i})$\r\n$x=u t=\\frac{1}{2} g t^{2}$\r\n$=192.6-\\frac{1}{2} 32.6^{2}$\r\n$=576 \\mathrm{ft}$",
